{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101269","id":2265468553,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6HCE6J","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101269","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101269.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101269.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101269","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101269/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101269/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101269/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8ef456858d8d2f6ec82651daeba3285aebe097c9","number":101269,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix variant rejecting dying RefCounted","user":{"login":"zhehangd","id":9572364,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzIzNjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9572364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd","html_url":"https://github.com/zhehangd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhehangd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/80834\r\n\r\nTo summarize, the following code tries to do something in the predelete callback\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends RefCounted\r\n\r\nvar _instance_id = get_instance_id()\r\n\r\nfunc _init() -> void:\r\n    pass\r\n\r\nfunc _notification(what: int) -> void:\r\n    if what == NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE:\r\n        print(\"predelete. self:%s is_instance_id_valid:%s instance_from_id:%s\" %\r\n              [self, is_instance_id_valid(_instance_id), instance_from_id(_instance_id)])\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut unfortunately `self` becomes `null` so we can not access the members of the instance. The same happens to `instance_from_id` which gives `<Object#null>` but `is_instance_id_valid` correctly returns `true`. This bug only applies to `RefCounted` and subclasses. The print statement gives\r\n\r\n```text\r\npredelete. self:<Object#null> is_instance_id_valid:true instance_from_id:<Object#null>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe reason behind it is that `Variant` does not accept a dying RefCounted because it can not perform a success reference operation. In `Variant::ObjData::ref`\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nif (id.is_ref_counted()) {\r\n    RefCounted *reference = static_cast<RefCounted *>(obj);\r\n    // Assuming reference is not null because id.is_ref_counted() was true.\r\n    if (!reference->reference()) {\r\n        *this = ObjData();\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n`reference->reference()` returns `false` because the count is zero, so `Variant` sets itself a null object.\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the issue by making `Variant::ObjData`  treat RefCounted as a regular Object if the count is zero, meaning it will skip the ref/unref operations. This is okay because the object is still valid and no one else is holding the object, so there is no difference between such an object and a regular unmanaged object.\r\n\r\nAfter the fix the above experiment gives the following output as expected:\r\n\r\n```text\r\npredelete. self:<RefCounted#-9223372007175879347> is_instance_id_valid:true instance_from_id:<RefCounted#-9223372007175879347>\r\n```\r\n\r\nTest project:\r\n[test-predelete-refcounted.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18343973/test-predelete-refcounted.tar.gz)\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com